    "body": "claimed: main session (review fixes for PR #82) · 2026-11-07T13:41Z · branch issue/77-cross-drill-raw-stock · plan: the independent review found the P0 fix still incomplete - (1) an off-centre hole's mouth and approach-end are checked on the centre line only, so the drill's edge can end ~0.2 mm inside raw stock (r10 part, r20 stock, t=9, d=6, r_d=1 -> edge at r19.79); (2) the end-face swing proves only d/2 - a shank wider than the drill dips below the top. Fix both, tighten tests (STOCK_R + d/2, a box stock, an off-centre spindle with wider stock, test 4 asserts the stale refusal), refuse holes pointing away from the spindle by name.",
